<title>UK: C&amp;W up on reports Deutsche Telekom interested.</title>
<headline>C&amp;W up on reports Deutsche Telekom interested.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-03-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shares in Cable &amp; Wireless Plc rose as the broad market dropped on Monday after a weekend press report said Deutsche Telekom AG was negotiating to buy a stake in the British communications concern, dealers said.</p>
<p>At 0836 GMT, C&amp;W shares were up 10p to 516.</p>
